{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19192","headline":"酬令狐相公使宅别斋初栽桂树见怀之作 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬令狐相公使宅别斋初栽桂树见怀之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清淮南岸家山树，黑水东边第一栽。\n影近画梁迎晓日，香随绿酒入金杯。\n根留本土依江润，叶起寒棱映月开。\n早晚阴城比梧竹，九霄还放彩雏来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19192.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19192","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}